  "prefLabel": "Plc 1804.05 Substantially-Similar Professional Experience",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1804.05 Substantially-Similar Professional Experience. In lieu of the specific training required by Plc 1804.04, an individual shall have substantially-similar professional work experience that provides training and experience in the topics listed in Plc 1804.04(b), in a similar field such as real estate brokerage or real estate appraisals for non-assessing purposes, in any assessing jurisdiction that is within the definition of “another jurisdiction” in Plc 1802.03.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
